    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e3c684d65e9462683d9ae21",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田路和爱慕织姬都是刚刚升上经典级，\n正因为还有成长空间……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d14d00d0aaf97f73f8437bbade8f8cc0bc22d1a4a3a268022c002a9af0bdb7ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d6bc319107a6e1068a04c71",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一个不注意就可能会使情况急转直下。\n反过来，也能成为逆袭的机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6303ecab7a3625d0dda796c807df5e8f1e5a2be70cab2db6165ed9f9963ed87",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed5c2c5984c0963636cc4fde",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论如何都想让成田路保持最佳的状态。\n但是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "891553baffcba3b0d516d50fd654b74388ec508b1a586a313568a0243f9f989f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33932a8e43394590a3dee42b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "截止到『皋月赏』当天结束为止。\n中间会发生什么都不得而知。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0268427151d6dae50e458b2ebc3765454de851116749b4aae0ffdc16bd532d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077305.json",
      "json_path": [
