    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fc07e98c2b68a08b87f1a32",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "试着让她们一起跑我顿时就明白了，\n爱慕织姬最强大的武器是——\n“在最终直线上的凌厉攻势”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "638c58ef357a79b6420c6d3224bfcccaf7050087579a06725db66e16bc33053e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db9c8de3c6dbd05b19a77009",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论是全程维持高速状态，\n还是开始慢速而后以末脚定胜负。\n这些――都是威胁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d8eff8f928b9ea30a75b23edbbbd7f415540b922d2e3043f3520b8e16145382",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc41ea57616daf0f97b37613",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是真正的威胁并非是这些东西。\n真的令人恐惧的是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "435e09cacc9a4ce4162d4cd72f7e39a374c3ff9b64d08b24e09ed2a81f0347e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80c941107d66b6413e87d0f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对比赛近乎“執念”一般的信念。\n她这到底是为什么呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "983a68f533873c0028066fee52a717595566f6ecca84a6fd3fc7b08613933f79",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b11a262f9d9d519606fe66ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "弥生赏之后·光与暗的相遇",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a8df802264713b99912633259b8ba10fb1977547620bdf71b3bfad055bb65bd",
